  triage:title "local_ipc_transport.rs Mutex missing rationale comment" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/local_ipc_transport.rs:40 — QA reported Mutex at line 40 lacks a rationale comment. TRIAGE VERDICT: INVALID. Lines 37-39 contain an explicit rationale comment: 'The serve loop needs to retain the full typed accept failure for later propagation, so a mutex-backed slot is required here; an atomic flag alone could not carry the original AtmError across the lifecycle/accept thread boundary.' Invariant and reasoning are both documented. No fix required. Workspace sweep found zero additional unrationed Mutex usages in non-test production code." ;
